#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:113
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is a browser-based app, so you only need an internet browser to "
"use it. You can run FluencyPal on a mobile phone, tablet, or desktop "
"without installing anything."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal er en browserbaseret app, så du behøver kun en internetbrowser "
"for at bruge den. Du kan køre FluencyPal på en mobiltelefon, tablet eller "
"desktop uden at installere noget."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:35
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is an AI-powered conversation practice app designed for "
"intermediate and advanced learners. It helps you improve speaking fluency, "
"pronunciation, and confidence through realistic conversations and instant "
"feedback."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal er en AI-drevet samtaleøvelsesapp designet til mellemliggende og "
"avancerede elever. Den hjælper dig med at forbedre taleflydende, udtale og "
"selvtillid gennem realistiske samtaler og øjeblikkelig feedback."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:56
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is best suited for learners who can hold basic conversations and "
"want to improve fluency, accuracy, and confidence. It works well for "
"pre-intermediate, intermediate, and advanced speakers and adapts to your "
"level over time."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal er bedst egnet til elever, der kan føre grundlæggende samtaler "
"og ønsker at forbedre flydende tale, præcision og selvtillid. Det fungerer "
"godt for præ-intermediate, intermediate og avancerede talere og tilpasser "
"sig dit niveau over tid."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:127
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is designed to help you practice speaking and build confidence, "
"not to replace a human teacher. It works best as a daily speaking companion "
"that helps you practice more often, get instant feedback, and prepare for "
"real conversations."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal er designet til at hjælpe dig med at øve dig i at tale og "
"opbygge selvtillid, ikke til at erstatte en menneskelig lærer. Det fungerer "
"bedst som en daglig samtalepartner, der hjælper dig med at øve dig oftere, "
"få øjeblikkelig feedback og forberede dig til rigtige samtaler."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:84
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is focused on speaking practice. You can use voice mode and "
"optionally enable webcam feedback with an AI avatar to make conversations "
"feel more realistic and engaging, while receiving feedback on your speaking "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal er fokuseret på taletræning. Du kan bruge talefunktion og "
"eventuelt aktivere webcam-feedback med en AI-avatar for at gøre samtalerne "
"mere realistiske og engagerende, mens du modtager feedback på din "
"taleydelse."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:49
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal offers Free and monthly plans that give you full access to all "
"features. There is no automatic recurring payment. Each month, you decide "
"whether you want to continue and pay again manually. This way, you are "
"never charged when you are not using the app."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal tilbyder gratis og månedlige planer, der giver dig fuld adgang "
"til alle funktioner. Der er ingen automatisk tilbagevendende betaling. Hver "
"måned beslutter du, om du vil fortsætte og betale igen manuelt. På denne "
"måde bliver du aldrig opkrævet, når du ikke bruger appen."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:99
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal offers several learning modes: Casual Conversation for "
"uninterrupted speaking practice, Talk & Correct for instant grammar and "
"pronunciation feedback, Role-Play Scenarios for real-life situations, as "
"well as grammar practice, vocabulary building, and progress tracking."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal tilbyder flere læringstilstande: Uformel Samtale for uafbrudt "
"taletræning, Tal & Ret for øjeblikkelig feedback på grammatik og udtale, "
"Rollespilsscenarier for virkelige situationer, samt grammatikøvelser, "
"ordforrådsopbygning og fremskridtssporing."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:120
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal stores conversation transcripts in its database to improve your "
"learning experience. You can permanently delete your personal data at any "
"time from the app settings. Voice processing is handled using OpenAI "
"services, and FluencyPal does not store your voice recordings. Webcam data "
"is not stored either — it is processed in real time by the AI and then "
"immediately discarded."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal gemmer samtaletransskriptioner i sin database for at forbedre "
"din læringsoplevelse. Du kan permanent slette dine personlige data når som "
"helst fra app-indstillingerne. Stemmebehandling håndteres ved hjælp af "
"OpenAI-tjenester, og FluencyPal gemmer ikke dine stemmeoptagelser. "
"Webcam-data gemmes heller ikke — det behandles i realtid af AI'en og bliver "
"derefter straks kasseret."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:134
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal tracks your activity and completed tasks over time. As you "
"practice regularly, conversations become more complex, and feedback adapts "
"to your level, helping you notice improvements in fluency, confidence, and "
"accuracy. FluencyPal also assesses your grammar, confidence, vocabulary, "
"and fluency, then creates a progress chart so you can see how your skills "
"grow over time."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal sporer din aktivitet og gennemførte opgaver over tid. "
"Efterhånden som du øver dig regelmæssigt, bliver samtalerne mere komplekse, "
"og feedback tilpasses dit niveau, hvilket hjælper dig med at bemærke "
"forbedringer i flydende sprog, selvtillid og nøjagtighed. FluencyPal "
"vurderer også din grammatik, selvtillid, ordforråd og sproglige flydende, "
"og derefter skabes et fremskridtsdiagram, så du kan se, hvordan dine "
"færdigheder vokser over tid."

