#: src/features/RolePlay/rolePlayData.tsx:438
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Step into a realistic interview environment and practice showcasing your "
"professional strengths. This role-play helps you handle common interview "
"questions, discuss your experience, and demonstrate why you’re the right "
"candidate.\n"
"\n"
"## Why You Should Play *Job Interview*  \n"
"1. Master the art of professional communication, from introducing yourself "
"to highlighting key skills.  \n"
"2. Gain confidence navigating tricky interview questions and providing "
"thoughtful, structured answers.  \n"
"3. Learn how to present your achievements clearly, whether you have "
"extensive experience or are just starting out.  \n"
"4. Receive real-time feedback on tone, clarity, and overall presentation to "
"refine your interview style.  \n"
"5. Develop the poise and readiness you need for any real-life interview "
"scenario.\n"
"\n"
"## How the Scenario Works  \n"
"In this scenario, you’ll take on the role of a job candidate while our AI "
"acts as a professional recruiter. You’ll be asked about your experience, "
"skills, and motivations for the role, with the AI adjusting difficulty "
"based on your responses. Use the prompts to practice delivering concise, "
"persuasive answers that help you stand out in any job interview.\n"
msgstr ""
"Træd ind i et realistisk interviewmiljø og øv dig i at fremvise dine "
"professionelle styrker. Denne rollespil hjælper dig med at håndtere "
"almindelige interviewspørgsmål, diskutere din erfaring og demonstrere, "
"hvorfor du er den rigtige kandidat.\n"
"\n"
"## Hvorfor Du Bør Deltage i *Job Interview* \n"
"1. Mestre kunsten at kommunikere professionelt, fra at præsentere dig selv "
"til at fremhæve nøglefærdigheder.\n"
"2. Få mere selvtillid ved at navigere igennem svære interviewspørgsmål og "
"give eftertænksomme, strukturerede svar.\n"
"3. Lær at præsentere dine præstationer tydeligt, uanset om du har "
"omfattende erfaring eller netop er begyndt.  \n"
"4. Modtag realtids feedback om tone, klarhed og generel præsentation for at "
"finpudse din interviewstil.  \n"
"5. Udvikle den ro og parathed, du har brug for til ethvert realistisk "
"interviewscenarie.\n"
"\n"
"## Sådan Fungerer Scenariet  \n"
"I dette scenarie vil du påtage dig rollen som en jobkandidat, mens vores AI "
"fungerer som en professionel rekrutterer. Du vil blive spurgt om dine "
"erfaringer, evner og motivation for rollen, og AI justerer sværhedsgraden "
"baseret på dine svar. Brug anvisningerne til at øve dig i at levere "
"præcise, overbevisende svar, der hjælper dig med at skille dig ud i ethvert "
"jobinterview."

